al novelty concerns, method doesn't work on real data\"]\n    narrative_direction: \"需要完全 reframe，但仍冲 EMNLP main。新 angle：'When Debiasing Hurts: A Large-Scale Empirical Study of Measurement Error Amplification in LLM-Annotated Causal Inference'——转型为 empirical contribution paper。核心卖点变为：(1) 14 LLM-dataset combinations × 6 models (3 generations) 的 systematic empirical evidence 证明 heterogeneous misclassification 是 structural phenomenon（R²=0.944），这是迄今最大规模的 LLM annotation error heterogeneity 实证研究；(2) bias identity 降级为 supporting theory（'consistent with classical ME theory, we verify the product-form identity holds empirically across...'），不 claim formal novelty；(3) EC-HTE 降级为 appendix-level 'one possible correction approach with known limitations'，主文 focus 转向 'what practitioners should check before applying any global correction'；(4) Diagnostic 重新 frame 为 'empirical rule of thumb'（Δπ > threshold → don't use global correction），不 claim AUC-based prediction。贡献变为 empirical discovery + practical guidelines，类似 Ribeiro et al. (2020) 'Beyond Accuracy' 的 empirical-contribution 模式。需要新增的工作：(a) 更多 real-data LLM-dataset combinations 的 Δπ 分析扩展到 20+ combos，(b) practitioner-oriented decision flowchart figure，(c) 与 calibration (exp-037) 的关系作为 practical recommendation 的核心。\"\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"eb14b2bb-7025-4ead-996a-0fab8e4a37fc","total_cost_usd":0.338696,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":27134,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"output_tokens":5639,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":27134,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":5639,"cache_read_input_tokens":11841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":27134,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":27134},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":22103,"outp